  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuberculosis - Nicaragua (01-Jul-2016-31-Dec-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua, Tuberculosis, Instituto Nicarag&#xfc;ense de Seguridad Social (INSS)This program has the following goals: Reduce the TB burden at 25% by 2020.  Reduce the TB mortality rate in 35% by 2020. The objectives of this program are: Contribute to operational , epidemiological and clinical research, implementation of initiatives and new technologies of rapid diagnostics for tuberculosis control..  Contribute to the prevention and integrated TB care focusing on people affected by Tuberculosis..  Strengthen the political commitment , the capacity of the National Program , communities , social organizations, public and private providers in prevention, care and TB control.</narrative>
  </description>
